   "en": "A occult comedy centred on junior high school boy Yamakawa and his classmate Unno. By chance, Yamakawa learns that Unno has the power to “turn any photograph he takes into a ghost photo”, and proposes to put the ghost photos he has taken up for internet sale. The two sell the photos in a casual way, but the price of the bid exceeds their expectations by far."
